Package: local.triggrvpnbridge
Name: Triggr VPN Bridge
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Andrey Samokhvalov <110901407+Dronicsam@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: Andrey Samokhvalov
Section: Tweaks
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), firmware (<< 17.0), ellekit, notifyutil
Homepage: https://github.com/Dronicsam/TriggrVPNBridge
Description: Toggle the selected system VPN from Triggr without Shortcuts.
 Includes Triggr action-picker integration and a command-line wrapper.
 Uses private iOS APIs. See the compatibility notes before installing.
